          "type": null,
          "body": "Request:\n```\nAMS\n    AMS Target Net Id: 10.10.75.15.1.1\n    AMS Target port: 851\n    AMS Sender Net Id: 10.10.55.15.1.1\n    AMS Sender port: 32768\n    CmdId: ADS Read (2)\n    StateFlags: 0x0004, ADS COMMAND\n    cbData: 12\n    ErrorCode: NO ERROR (0x00000000)\n    InvokeId: 0x00000001\n    [Response In: 2]\n    ADS Read Request\n```\n\nResponse:\n```\nAMS\n    AMS Target Net Id: 10.10.55.15.1.1\n    AMS Target port: 32768\n    AMS Sender Net Id: 10.10.75.15.1.1\n    AMS Sender port: 851\n    CmdId: ADS Read (2)\n    StateFlags: 0x0005, RESPONSE, ADS COMMAND\n    cbData: 32\n    ErrorCode: NO ERROR (0x00000000)\n    InvokeId: 0x00000001\n    [Request In: 1]\n    [Response Time: 38.668000 milliseconds]\n    ADS Read Response\n```\n\nexample capture: [ams.pcapng](/uploads/c86475e6834d1826414f7ae253755032/ams.pcapng)",
